            "review_title": "Review at Marcel - Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Akxhay K\nPune, India77 contributions\n0\nMarcel Gourmet Burger is a rare gem that effortlessly combines culinary excellence with warm hospitality. From the moment you st\nMar 2025 • Couples\nMarcel Gourmet Burger is a total gem, blending amazing food with a super welcoming vibe. From the moment you walk in, it feels stylish yet comfy—great for a relaxed meal or a nice casual dinner.\n\nThe food's incredible. Each burger is perfectly made with top-notch ingredients that make classic flavors amazing. Whether it's their signature burger with that awesome raclette cheese or the spicy chicken burger, every bite is seriously good.\n\nThe service is fantastic too—friendly, helpful, and fast, making the whole experience smooth. With its great food, fair prices, and effortlessly cool atmosphere, Marcel Gourmet Burger is a must-try for anyone who loves a really great burger.\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
