            "review_title": "Review at Marcel - Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Joh\n1 contribution\n0\nNot good service, not care about customers\nNov 2022\nI really like Marcel restaurant, i usually have dinner in Marcel in D1, and sometime in Thao Dien. Last week, i and my son went there, at that time no customer at all, staffs just gather to talk with a grab food service. We was sitting there nearly 15 minutes but no one come to ask us. I tried to look at them to see if they look as us or not, but they didnt. We stand up and left the restaurant but none of them ask us why we left.\n\nI never want to come back this restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 14, 2022",
